me = kenaikan valid. Harga naik + volume sepi = bisa jadi prank! Selalu cek volume sebelum masuk.","category":"teknikal","definition":"Jumlah lembar saham yang diperdagangkan dalam satu sesi/hari."},{"term":"Foreign Flow","analogi":"Investor asing kayak influencer besar masuk pasar. Net buy = mereka borong = bisa jadi sinyal positif. Net sell = mereka kabur = worth it buat waspada, tapi jangan langsung panik!","category":"teknikal","definition":"Arah arus uang dari investor asing — apakah mereka net buy (beli lebih banyak) atau net sell (jual lebih banyak) hari ini."}],"title":"Kamus Ala Gen Z","handle":"@sahamfyp","subtitle":"Biar lo ngerti istilah di slide sebelumnya 👆","template":"kamus","slideIndex":8,"totalSlides":10,"dateIndonesia":"Rabu, 16 September 2026","foreignFlowSummary":{"raw":{"net_buy":381195836600,"net_sell":-1084776895400,"net_total":-703581058800},"net_buy":"+Rp 381.20M","net_sell":"-Rp 1.08T","is_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 703.58M"}},{"date":"2026-09-17","title":"Gimana Menurutmu?","handle":"@sahamfyp","template":"cta","disclaimer":"DYOR — Konten ini murni edukasi, bukan ajakan jual/beli saham.","slideIndex":9,"visualIcon":"MessageCircle","description":"Dari 4 katalis hari ini, mana yang paling bikin lo penasaran? Drop di komen! 👇","totalSlides":10,"dateIndonesia":"Rabu, 16 September 2026","foreignFlowSummary":{"raw":{"net_buy":381195836600,"net_sell":-1084776895400,"net_total":-703581058800},"net_buy":"+Rp 381.20M","net_sell":"-Rp 1.08T","is_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 703.58M"}}]', 10, '2026-09-17 06:50:23.498244+00', '2026-09-17 06:50:23.498244+00', 'generated', 'generated', null, null, null, null, null, 0, 0, 0, 0), ('67de5fa3-b891-4f3e-a190-0937ced48a37', null, '@sahamfyp', 'GEMS', '#14182B', '#FFFFFF', '[{"title":"GEMS Dapat Suntikan Dana Segar USD42 Juta!","accent":"#F2A93B","source":"https://www.idxchannel.com/","template":"cover","visualIcon":"Rocket","visualMode":"image","description":"Buat apa dana jumbo ini dipaka