_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 703.58M"}},{"date":"2026-09-17","note":"Ini framework analisis, bukan saran beli/jual. DYOR & konsultasi financial advisor!","title":"Kesimpulan Watchlist Hari Ini","handle":"@sahamfyp","stocks":[{"ticker":"DRMA.JK","quadrant":"q2"},{"ticker":"MBMA.JK","quadrant":"q4"},{"ticker":"SMRA.JK","quadrant":"q4"},{"ticker":"MGLV.JK","quadrant":"q4"}],"q1Label":"Cocok untuk: Investasi jangka panjang & Swing Trading","q2Label":"Cocok untuk: Value Investing — sabar nunggu teknikal pulih","q3Label":"Cocok untuk: Trading momentum jangka pendek SAJA","q4Label":"Hindari dulu — tunggu sinyal pemulihan","subtitle":"Framework: Matrix Fundamental × Teknikal","template":"matrix","slideIndex":7,"totalSlides":10,"dateIndonesia":"Rabu, 16 September 2026","foreignFlowSummary":{"raw":{"net_buy":381195836600,"net_sell":-1084776895400,"net_total":-703581058800},"net_buy":"+Rp 381.20M","net_sell":"-Rp 1.08T","is_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 703.58M"}},{"date":"2026-09-17","items":[{"term":"PER","analogi":"Beli HP Rp15jt, tiap tahun lo \\"untung\\" Rp1jt → PER = 15x, alias 15 tahun modal balik. Makin kecil = makin cepet \\"balik modal\\".","category":"fundamental","definition":"Price to Earnings Ratio — Berapa tahun balik modal kalau laba perusahaan segini terus."},{"term":"PBV","analogi":"Beli barang preloved. Harga asli Rp1jt tapi lo bayar Rp3jt (PBV 3x) = lo bayar mahal buat \\"brand\\"-nya doang. PBV < 1 = beli aset di bawah nilai buku = diskon!","category":"fundamental","definition":"Price to Book Value — Lo bayar berapa kali lipat dari aset bersih perusahaan."},{"term":"ROE","analogi":"2 temen patungan jastip. Modal Rp1jt untung Rp200rb (ROE 20%) vs modal Rp5jt untung Rp200rb (ROE 4%). Yang ROE tinggi = jago ngolah modal!","category":"fundamental","definition":"Return on Equity — Seberapa efisien modal sendiri perusahaan menghasilkan cuan."},{"term":"DER","analogi":"Kayak paylater. DER 1x = utang = modal sendiri. DER 3x = utang 3x lipat modal — makin gede, makin gampang \\"kepontal\\" kalau kondisi bisnis memburuk.","category":"fundamental","definition":"Debt to Equity Ratio — Utang perusahaan dibanding modal sendiri."},{"term":"Market Cap","analogi":"Kalau lo mau \\"beli\\" seluruh perusahaan sekarang di harga pasar, berapa duit yang lo butuhin? Itu Market Cap. BBCA ~Rp900T = butuh Rp900 Triliun buat borong semua sahamnya.","category":"fundamental","definition":"Market Capitalization — Total nilai pasar seluruh saham yang beredar."},{"term":"MA20 & MA50","analogi":"MA20 = mood pasar bulan ini. MA50 = mood 2.5 bulan terakhir. Harga di atas keduanya = saham lagi on top. Di bawah keduanya = bad vibes.","category":"teknikal","definition":"Moving Average 20 & 50 hari — Rata-rata harga penutupan saham selama 20 atau 50 hari perdagangan terakhir."},{"term":"Golden & Death Cross","analogi":"Golden Cross 🚀 = MA20 motong ke ATAS MA50 (sinyal bullish — momentum naik). Death Cross ☠️ = MA20 motong ke BAWAH MA50 (sinyal bearish — waspada downtrend).","category":"teknikal","definition":"Sinyal pembalikan tren dari perpotongan MA20 dan MA50."},{"term":"Support & Resistance","analogi":"Support = lantai harga, susah tembus ke bawah. Resistance = plafon harga, susah tembus ke atas. Kalau salah satunya jebol dengan volume besar, harga bisa lari jauh!","category":"teknikal","definition":"Level harga di mana saham cenderung berhenti turun (support) atau berhenti naik (resistance)."},{"term":"Volume Trading","analogi":"Volume tinggi = warung mie ayam super rame. Harga naik + volume rame = kenaikan valid. Harga naik + volume sepi = bisa jadi prank! Selalu cek volume sebelum masuk.","category":"teknikal","definition":"Jumlah lembar saham yang diperdagangkan dalam satu sesi/hari."},{"term":"Foreign Flow","analogi":"Investor asing kayak influencer besar masuk pasar. Net buy = mereka borong = bisa jadi sinyal positif. Net sell = mereka kabur = worth it buat waspada, tapi jangan langsung panik!","category":"teknikal","definition