V","analogi":"Beli barang preloved. Harga asli Rp1jt tapi lo bayar Rp3jt (PBV 3x) = lo bayar mahal buat \\"brand\\"-nya doang. PBV < 1 = beli aset di bawah nilai buku = diskon!","category":"fundamental","definition":"Price to Book Value — Lo bayar berapa kali lipat dari aset bersih perusahaan."},{"term":"ROE","analogi":"2 temen patungan jastip. Modal Rp1jt untung Rp200rb (ROE 20%) vs modal Rp5jt untung Rp200rb (ROE 4%). Yang ROE tinggi = jago ngolah modal!","category":"fundamental","definition":"Return on Equity — Seberapa efisien modal sendiri perusahaan menghasilkan cuan."},{"term":"DER","analogi":"Kayak paylater. DER 1x = utang = modal sendiri. DER 3x = utang 3x lipat modal — makin gede, makin gampang \\"kepontal\\" kalau kondisi bisnis memburuk.","category":"fundamental","definition":"Debt to Equity Ratio — Utang perusahaan dibanding modal sendiri."},{"term":"Market Cap","analogi":"Kalau lo mau \\"beli\\" seluruh perusahaan sekarang di harga pasar, berapa duit yang lo butuhin? Itu Market Cap. BBCA ~Rp900T = butuh Rp900 Triliun buat borong semua sahamnya.","category":"fundamental","definition":"Market Capitalization — Total nilai pasar seluruh saham yang beredar."},{"term":"MA20 & MA50","analogi":"MA20 = mood pasar bulan ini. MA50 = mood 2.5 bulan terakhir. Harga di atas keduanya = saham lagi on top. Di bawah keduanya = bad vibes.","category":"teknikal","definition":"Moving Average 20 & 50 hari — Rata-rata harga penutupan saham selama 20 atau 50 hari perdagangan terakhir."},{"term":"Golden & Death Cross","analogi":"Golden Cross 🚀 = MA20 motong ke ATAS MA50 (sinyal bullish — momentum naik). Death Cross ☠️ = MA20 motong ke BAWAH MA50 (sinyal bearish — waspada downtrend).","category":"teknikal","definition":"Sinyal pembalikan tren dari perpotongan MA20 dan MA50."},{"term":"Support & Resistance","analogi":"Support = lantai harga, susah tembus ke bawah. Resistance = plafon harga, susah tembus ke atas. Kalau salah satunya jebol dengan volume besar, harga bisa lari jauh!","category":"teknikal","definition":"Level harga di mana saham cenderung berhenti turun (support) atau berhenti naik (resistance)."},{"term":"Volume Trading","analogi":"Volume tinggi = warung mie ayam super rame. Harga naik + volume rame = kenaikan valid. Harga naik + volume sepi = bisa jadi prank! Selalu cek volume sebelum masuk.","category":"teknikal","definition":"Jumlah lembar saham yang diperdagangkan dalam satu sesi/hari."},{"term":"Foreign Flow","analogi":"Investor asing kayak influencer besar masuk pasar. Net buy = mereka borong = bisa jadi sinyal positif. Net sell = mereka kabur = worth it buat waspada, tapi jangan langsung panik!","category":"teknikal","definition":"Arah arus uang dari investor asing — apakah mereka net buy (beli lebih banyak) atau net sell (jual lebih banyak) hari ini."}],"title":"Kamus Ala Gen Z","handle":"@sahamfyp","subtitle":"Biar lo ngerti istilah di slide sebelumnya 👆","template":"kamus","slideIndex":8,"totalSlides":10,"dateIndonesia":"Kamis, 17 September 2026","foreignFlowSummary":{"raw":{"net_buy":724777115500,"net_sell":-851504659300,"net_total":-126727543800},"net_buy":"+Rp 724.78M","net_sell":"-Rp 851.50M","is_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 126.73M"}},{"date":"2026-09-18","title":"Gimana Menurutmu?","handle":"@sahamfyp","template":"cta","disclaimer":"DYOR — Konten ini murni edukasi, bukan ajakan jual/beli saham.","slideIndex":9,"visualIcon":"MessageCircle","description":"Dari 4 katalis hari ini, mana yang paling bikin lo penasaran? Drop di komen! 👇","totalSlides":10,"dateIndonesia":"Kamis, 17 September 2026","foreignFlowSummary":{"raw":{"net_buy":724777115500,"net_sell":-851504659300,"net_total":-126727543800},"net_buy":"+Rp 724.78M","net_sell":"-Rp 851.50M","is_inflow":false,"net_foreign_flow":"-Rp 126.73M"}}]', 10, '2026-09-18 07:02:16.189871+00', '2026-09-18 07:02:16.189871+00', 'generated', 'generated', null, null, null, null, null, 0, 0, 0, 0), ('e6fb8590-696b-4b49-aa77-40f5f9a0b6e4', null, '@sahamfyp', 'OPEN', '#